{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>跟著的哥搵食，總有意外驚喜！在昨晚（9月4日）播出的TVB節目《美食新聞報道》中，「美食揸的日與夜」的的哥華仔帶林映暉（暉哥）殺入尖沙咀，並非品嚐遊客區的常規美食，而是挑戰一間專門供應牛隻刁鑽部位的火鍋店。五花趾、牛駝峰、滑尾龍等罕見名詞一出，立即引起觀眾好奇，究竟這些部位有何特別之處？</p><p>哥華仔帶路食好西 林映暉挑戰牛駝峰五花趾</p><p>的哥華仔果然是識途老馬，他向林映暉詳細解說每款牛肉的由來。首先是「五花趾」，華仔指出這是位於牛小腿內的肉質，他說：「由於經常郁動，所以肉質較緊緻同爽口。」緊接著是「牛駝峰」，這個部位即是牛背靠近膊頭稍微凸起的地方，識食的華仔解釋：「肉同油脂比例啱啱好，軟熟帶肉香。」這兩個部位雖然名字刁鑽，但勝在人人都可以品嚐，不像牛歡喜般出位，卻同樣能帶來味蕾上的新衝擊，讓暉哥一試難忘。</p><p>暉哥再試超濃牛味滑尾龍 沾蛋漿灼20秒食法曝光</p><p>當晚的重頭戲，絕對是極為罕有的「滑尾龍」。的哥華仔介紹，這款肉來自牛尾對上、屁股位置的肉，每隻牛只能提供極少份量，可謂一肉難求。華仔更親授最佳食法，就是要先將牛肉沾滿蛋漿，再放入滾湯中輕灼20秒左右即可。據稱，這個食法能鎖住肉汁並提升嫩滑口感。在三款刁鑽部位之中，「滑尾龍」的牛味最為濃郁，其獨特的風味和口感讓林映暉大開眼界，完全體驗到本地人才知道的火鍋精髓。</p><p>網民激讚哥識食 跪求火鍋店地址</p><p>節目播出後，不少觀眾對的哥華仔的覓食功力佩服得五體投地，認為跟著他才能食到最地道的美食。網民的討論焦點都集中在幾款刁鑽牛肉部位上，紛紛留言表示大開眼界。「華仔真係識途老馬，跟佢食實冇死！」「牛駝峰？滑尾龍？第一次聽，好想試下！」「尖沙咀邊間呀？講個名嚟聽下！」「打邊爐就是要食呢啲特別嘢先過癮！」「暉哥好貼地，跟住的士大哥周圍食！」「睇到肚都餓，今個週末就要去打邊爐！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1_7011454546a9b9ae3b3e2a.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2_11394411406a9b9aece73cb.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/3_17508225546a9b9af5b0b1d.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/4_10655047616a9b9b042fd0c.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/5_15122315086a9b9b1075622.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/6_13191852246a9b9b1968383.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/7_21104945306a9b9b229fd47.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/8_759112656a9b9b2ca17b2.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/9_9323075076a9b9b33c211f.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/10_3160797796a9b9b400fba2.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/11_16807520016a9b9b4ce6d1c.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/12_7208123896a9b9b57edaf0.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/13_17093979796a9b9b640bd97.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14_5615066856a9b9b6db8692.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/15_2000054616a9b9b77ab225.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/16_12056524016a9b9b8bb9b96.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17_1877921666a9b9b945da75.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/18_9116323506a9b9b9cf179d.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/19_11231829196a9b9ba55d6f9.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20_17156301916a9b9badd45fd.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/21_13686282456a9b9bb55683f.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/22_2360134706a9b9bc073e30.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T04:38:21.381499+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1018,"images":22,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}